OL,3,GNEWSAShare Energy to increase
OL,4,Aelectricity prices by 12.6%
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorthern Ireland electricity supplier,
OL,7,FShare Energy, is to increase its tariff
OL,8,Fprices by 12.6% from 1 October.
OL,10,FThe supplier said the industry has
OL,11,Ffaced "exceptional volatility"
OL,12,Ffollowing Russia's invasion of Ukraine
OL,13,Fand instability in the Middle East.
OL,15,FThe company entered Northern Ireland's
OL,16,Felectricity market in 2004.
OL,18,FIts CEO Damian Wilson said it "isn't a
OL,19,Fdecision we've taken lightly" and has
OL,20,Fcalled on the government to address the
OL,21,FNorthern Ireland electricity sector's
OL,22,Fover-reliance on gas.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
